 78-Pt-192 LANL       EVAL-MAY24 M.Herman & T.Kawano              7831 1451
                      DIST-AUG24 REV1-JUL24            20240830   7831 1451
---- ENDF/B-VIII.1    MATERIAL 7831         REVISION 1            7831 1451
